Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.11,0:09:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're a pretty smart monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who trained you to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monkey like you is\Nactually into looking at...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.45,0:10:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pin-ups of girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.95,0:10:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid! Be careful—there,\Nthey say an orangutan
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has five times the\Nstrength of a normal human?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it could easily rip\Noff your arm come on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stay with us in the\Nroom on the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go off by yourself. Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.93,0:10:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had Hierophant Green\Nsearch every inch of this ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't find a single\Nsign of human life aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've searched every pipe and crevice,\Nbut still came up empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:10:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, try again, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sticky from the salt water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.83,0:11:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh...
