Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your lock, you stinking ape!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems at the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't your run-of-the-mill monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that he's the one?
