Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, who the hell ripped out that fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had to be him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this ape's a stand user,\Nbut where's the stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be able to see the\Ndamn thing, but I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The steel propeller bent\Non its own like it's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.43,0:13:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no stand in sight\Nand somehow the window broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.15,0:14:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.19,0:14:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ape just sank into\Nthe wall and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you saw that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.59,0:14:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.15,0:14:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something bad is going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.39,0:14:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ape vanished into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that orangutan has\Nto be the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I touched it earlier, I felt\Na stand's energy coming from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that he's\Nthe one we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I see this\Nstand like I always do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.41,0:14:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I'm seeing it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.27,0:14:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.57,0:14:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's swallowing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the freighter trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible the ship itself is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the stand is actually the freighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.73,0:15:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.47,0:15:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship itself and everything\Non it is a gigantic stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there are stands that non-stand users
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like that girl and the\Ncrew members can see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only possible explanation\Nfor that is that its immense
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,energy is making it possibly\Nseen with the naked eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all this must demand a tremendous\Namount of energy to operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand as huge as this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick, send Hierophant Green to Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.35,0:15:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can help get us out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got a firm hold\Non my Stand! I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to face\Ndeath We fell for this trap
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.89,0:15:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now we're hopelessly\Nensnared with no way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pressure keeps increasing at this rate\Nour bodies are going to be pulverized!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will be damn. We were careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.03,0:16:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The word that the orangutan\Nwas pointing to was strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means force, energy, power, or aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it is the eighth\Ncard of the tarot deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It suggests challenge, a\Nstrong will, and hidden powers.
