Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.55,0:16:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinks he's won already, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This entire ship is my\Nstand, and you've lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're totally outmatched and helpless!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:16:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro needed no explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew exactly what the ape was saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaahhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That button's not part of your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it wounded your pride, since\Nyou thought you'd already beaten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's not hurt at all, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because apes like you\Ndon't have any pride.
