Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.15,0:17:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what makes\Nyou an ape and not a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going to hurt now is your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.85,0:18:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that when\Nfrightened animals show their
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stomachs to signal their\Nsubmission to the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're asking me to forgive you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your actions have already\Ngone beyond the rules of the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I don't think so.
