Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pipes and walls are distorting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole ship is twisting up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, be surprised about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.53,0:18:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship is about to sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.09,0:18:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back to the lifeboats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship's shape is changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's turning into a shabby little boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't seen it myself,\NI wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ape was traveling\Nthe sea on his own stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What terrifying power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I've\Nencountered such energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but we were\Ncompletely overwhelmed this round.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.67,0:19:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Jotaro hadn't figured it out,\Nwe would have been done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we going to encounter even more stands\Nwith crazy unknown powers from now on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to be ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you want some gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.11,0:19:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we're going to be\Ndrifting again. Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cigarettes are soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be plenty of sun and\Ntime for them to get dry, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to pray that we get\Nrescued and reach Singapore safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.15,0:19:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.81,0:19:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been four days since we left Japan.
