Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord, it would appear that\Nstrength has been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.85,0:20:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The remaining six stand users are all very\Npowerful and each deadlier than the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one of them is my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.11,0:20:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His right arm shall crush our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Joestars will not pose a threat\Nwhen he's finished with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.85,0:20:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a strange old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.19,0:20:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it that you desire the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.79,0:20:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I've told you many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only wish is to stay\Nby your side, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your guardian spirit\Nhas unbelievable power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ability to escape trouble and your\Nstrange life are the result of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to see your life unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.73,0:21:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.11,0:21:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there was a prince from the land of Sumatra\Nwho traveled the seas seeking new lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he happened upon an island\Ninhabited by lions called Sinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.91,0:21:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an island he named Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today, it's straights bustle with ships\Nand tankers from around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This nation that shares\Nboth Western and Eastern
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heritage thanks to free\Ntrade is Tropical Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, we finally\Nmade it to dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll clean up and get\Nsome rest at a hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we've recharged, we'll\Nfigure out our route to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.45,0:21:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's stay at that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.25,0:22:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.70,0:22:15.08,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.08,0:22:17.37,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.03,0:22:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you move too quick, go away.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.37,0:22:18.83,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.29,0:22:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.62,0:22:22.09,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the buzzer men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.09,0:22:24.42,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.42,0:22:26.76,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.41,0:22:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.76,0:22:28.26,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-eh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snapped their\Nteeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.93,0:22:31.39,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.99,0:22:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with a hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.39,0:22:33.60,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-eh-oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.60,0:22:43.15,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.93,0:22:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.99,0:22:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.53,0:22:57.00,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.99,0:22:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.00,0:22:59.37,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.99,0:23:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.37,0:23:00.62,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then\Nthey bring you more.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.67,0:23:04.00,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.65,0:23:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of folks.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.00,0:23:06.34,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
